        "@value": "Jeudis en musique - Bel and Quinn @ Place des spectacles - le 31 juil. 2025 à 19h30"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Meet Bel and Quinn, two sisters of Haitian descent. An electrifying blend of world music, soul, jazz, and funk, their performances are energetic and moving. Their voices blend seamlessly, bringing their music to life. Bring your chair or blanket! In case of rain, activities take place under the big top at the Place des Spectacles."
